# Wattleflow documentation — LOCAL-ONLY repository.
#
# Everything that is content is tracked: the doctrinal texts, the registers,
# the DR series and the policy layer all need a revisable change history,
# because D-03 requires a register to change through a decision record and
# D-11 forbids leaving that gap undeclared.
#
# Publication is a separate, deliberate act. Push to `origin` was enabled on
# 2026-09-09 by the maintainer's decision, superseding the earlier local-only
# lock; the Croatian texts are therefore published before the UK English
# edition of v1.0. That reverses `CLAUDE.md` §3.2 and §8 and was taken without
# a decision record — carried as a finding in `workflow/TODO.md` (D-03).
#
# Ignore build artefacts and tooling state only — never a document.

# --- Build artefacts and caches -------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
dist/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Editor and CI state ---------------------------------------------------
.github
.vscode
.claude

# --- Paths that are not content -------------------------------------------
# Symlink to a shared Makefile outside this repository — a path, not content.
Makefile

# --- Superseded drafts kept on disk, not in history ------------------------
*.bak
*.superseeded
# --- Ne objavljuje se: odluke, analize, zapisi uskladenja, worklist, nacrti ---
# Objavljuje se samo doktrinarni sloj i registri zahtjeva (odluka 2026-09-09).
# Posljedica je deklarirana: objavljeni tekstovi citiraju 04-DR/ i 06-ANALYSIS/,
# koji citatelju objavljenog izdanja nisu dostupni — nalaz u workflow/TODO.md.
04-DR/
05-METHODS/
06-ANALYSIS/
07-CHANGES/
workflow/analysis/
workflow/DONE.md
workflow/TODO.md
workflow/hr/
workflow/OLD-TODO.md
